# dbt SQL

- Reference relations with `ref()` or `source()` only — never hard-code database table names.
- Prefer lowercase SQL keywords.
- Prefer CTEs over nested subqueries; name CTEs for the step they represent.
- Comment non-obvious business logic (grain, filters, dedupe rules).
- Keep one logical transform per model file.
